flowchart TB
  Test["Container: local test runner<br/>pytest; synthetic inputs"]
  subgraph API["API code boundary - one Python application"]
    Factory["Component: application factory<br/>main.create_app; /health only"]
    Config["Component: settings<br/>config.Settings"]
    Headers["Component: response headers<br/>security.add_security_headers"]
    Orchestrator["Component: AI orchestrator<br/>Internal module; not HTTP mounted"]
    Registry["Component: model + template registries<br/>Role validation, versioned TOML, hashes"]
    Redaction["Component: redaction policy + redactor<br/>One in-memory placeholder mapping per call"]
    Client["Component: model client adapters<br/>FakeModelClient / mock-only AnthropicClient"]
    Audit["Component: audit sink + event model<br/>InMemoryAuditSink; no durable chain"]
    Domains["Placeholders: matters, documents, ledger<br/>No domain endpoints or persistence"]
  end
  Mock["Test-only provider transport<br/>Explicit in-process httpx2.MockTransport"]
  Test -->|Creates app| Factory
  Factory -->|Reads| Config
  Factory -->|Installs| Headers
  Test -->|Invokes directly| Orchestrator
  Orchestrator -->|Resolves task and template| Registry
  Orchestrator -->|Pseudonymises; later re-identifies| Redaction
  Orchestrator -->|Calls complete| Client
  Client -->|SDK serialization; no live network| Mock
  Orchestrator -->|Emits completion metadata| Audit
